# Fixed Wing Skid Setpoint message
#
# Part of the lateral acceleration setpoint that is generated by sideslip instead of bank (skid-to-turn).
# Published by the fw_lateral_longitudinal_control module whenever it runs the lateral controller.
# Used by fw_att_control for turn coordination and side-force control, and by the estimators to stop
# fusing the zero-sideslip assumption.

uint64 timestamp # [us] Time since system start

float32 lateral_acceleration # [m/s^2] [@frame FRD] Lateral specific force setpoint to be generated by sideslip. 0 if turning by bank only.
